msgid "Reading the hotends, please wait."
msgstr "Sedang membaca informasi hotend, mohon tunggu."

msgid "During the hotend upgrade, the toolhead will move. Don't reach into the chamber."
msgstr "Selama proses peningkatan hotend, toolhead akan bergerak. Jangan masukkan tangan Anda ke dalam ruangan."

