msgid "Click to reset all settings to the last saved preset."
msgstr "Klik untuk mengatur ulang semua pengaturan ke prasetel terakhir yang disimpan."

msgid ""
"When using soluble material for the support, We recommend the following settings:\n"
"0 top z distance, 0 bottom z distance, 0 interface spacing, 0 support/object xy distance, interlaced rectilinear \n"
"pattern, disable independent support layer height and use soluble materials for both support interface and support base"
msgstr ""
"Saat menggunakan material larut untuk penyangga, kami merekomendasikan pengaturan berikut:\n"
"Jarak z atas 0, jarak z bawah 0, jarak antarmuka 0, jarak xy penyangga/objek 0, pola rektilinear berselang-seling, nonaktifkan tinggi lapisan penyangga independen dan gunakan material larut untuk antarmuka penyangga dan dasar penyangga."

msgid ""
"When using soluble material for the support, We recommend the following settings:\n"
"0 top z distance, 0 interface spacing, 0 support/object xy distance, interlaced rectilinear pattern, disable \n"
"independent support layer height and use soluble materials for both support interface and support base"
msgstr ""
"Saat menggunakan bahan larut untuk penyangga, kami merekomendasikan pengaturan berikut:\n"
"jarak z atas 0, jarak antarmuka 0, jarak XY penyangga/model 0, pola garis lurus berjalin, nonaktifkan tinggi lapisan penyangga independen, dan gunakan bahan larut untuk antarmuka penyangga serta dasar penyangga."

msgid "Support interface speed"
msgstr "Kecepatan Antarmuka Penyangga"

msgid "When using support material for the support interface, We recommend the following settings:"
msgstr "Saat menggunakan material penyangga untuk antarmuka penyangga, kami merekomendasikan pengaturan berikut:"

msgid "Do you want to apply these settings?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda ingin menerapkan pengaturan ini?"

msgid "Prime tower is required for nozzle changing. There may be flaws on the model without prime tower. Are you sure you want to disable prime tower?"
msgstr "Menukar nosel memerlukan prime tower, jika tidak, mungkin ada cacat pada model cetakan. Apakah Anda yakin ingin menonaktifkan prime tower?"

msgid "Prime tower is required for smooth timeplase. There may be flaws on the model without prime tower. Are you sure you want to disable prime tower?"
msgstr "Prime tower diperlukan untuk *timelapse* yang halus. Mungkin ada cacat pada model tanpa prime tower. Apakah Anda yakin ingin menonaktifkan prime tower?"

msgid "Prime tower is required for clumping detection. There may be flaws on the model without prime tower. Are you sure you want to disable prime tower?"
msgstr "Deteksi penggumpalan memerlukan menara prime. Mungkin ada cacat pada model tanpa menara prime. Apakah Anda yakin ingin menonaktifkan menara prime?"

msgid "Enabling both precise Z height and the prime tower may cause the size of prime tower to increase. Do you still want to enable?"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan tinggi Z presisi dan prime tower dapat menyebabkan ukuran prime tower meningkat. Apakah Anda masih ingin mengaktifkannya?"

msgid "Prime tower is required for clumping detection. There may be flaws on the model without prime tower. Do you still want to enable clumping detection?"
msgstr "Deteksi penggumpalan membutuhkan menara prima, jika tidak, mungkin ada cacat pada model. Apakah Anda masih ingin mengaktifkan deteksi penggumpalan?"

#, c-format, boost-format
msgid ""
"The selected printer has a bed temperature limit of %d°C.\n"
"Setting a higher bed temperature may cause damage to the printer."
msgstr ""
"Suhu tempat tidur printer yang dipilih memiliki batas %d°C.\n"
"Mengatur suhu tempat tidur yang lebih tinggi dapat menyebabkan kerusakan pada printer."

msgid "Smooth timelapse needs a prime tower on every layer, which is not compatible with \"No sparse layers\". \"No sparse layers\" has been turned off."
msgstr "Timelapse halus memerlukan prime tower di setiap lapisan, yang tidak kompatibel dengan \"No sparse layers\". \"No sparse layers\" telah dimatikan."

msgid "Prime tower is required for smooth timelapse. There may be flaws on the model without prime tower. Do you want to enable prime tower?"
msgstr "Prime tower diperlukan untuk *timelapse* yang halus. Mungkin ada cacat pada model tanpa prime tower. Apakah Anda ingin mengaktifkan prime tower?"

msgid "\"No sparse layers\" is not compatible with smooth timelapse, which needs a prime tower on every layer. Timelapse has been switched to traditional mode."
msgstr "\"No sparse layers\" tidak kompatibel dengan timelapse halus, yang memerlukan prime tower di setiap lapisan. Timelapse telah diubah ke mode tradisional."

